{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"没在想\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他不再为想被珍惜自责，想靠近、想被同样珍惜，也想把攒下的关心给对方，看看两人能一起过怎样的日子。\",\n      \"key\": \"同样珍惜\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\n        \"B2\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他觉得自己有许多爱可以给，也觉得自己对这个人的感情值得珍惜，欢喜涌上来时连自己的得失都顾不上。\",\n      \"key\": \"许多爱可以给\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\n        \"B1\",\n        \"B2\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-3\",\n      \"text\": \"他仍盼对方也选择自己，可对方没给新保证，想要的回应还没有着落。\",\n      \"key\": \"没给新保证\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\n        \"B3\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他只想让眼前的欢喜多留一会儿，暂时顾不上以后能不能如愿，等欢喜退下，想被珍惜的心还会回来。\",\n      \"key\": \"欢喜多留\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\n        \"B2\",\n        \"B3\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\n        \"R51\",\n        \"R52\"\n      ],\n      \"now\": [\n        \"S12-1\"\n      ],\n      \"what\": \"合并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"把承认渴望后更清楚的愿望写具体：他想靠近、想被同样珍惜，也想付出关心、看看两人能一起过怎样的日子。删去“温柔有归处”和“共同拥有怎样的幸福”等抽象说法，避免重复罗列相近的愿望。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\n        \"R53\"\n      ],\n      \"now\": [\n        \"S12-1\",\n        \"S12-2\"\n      ],\n      \"what\": \"拆分改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留愿望仍在、却暂时不再折磨他的心理变化。用他不再为想被珍惜自责，以及欢喜涌上来时顾不上得失来说明原因，不把暂时的轻松写成作者替他宣布的进步。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\n        \"R54\",\n        \"R55\"\n      ],\n      \"now\": [\n        \"S12-2\",\n        \"S12-3\"\n      ],\n      \"what\": \"拆分改写\",\n      \"why\": \"找回他觉得自己有许多爱可以给、自己的感情值得珍惜这一真实的内在丰盈，并写出欢喜使他暂时顾不上自身得失，以解释自我退到后面的感受。删去“仿佛已经再无所缺”和“所有心愿都得到抒发”的结论，因为愿望被充分感受不等于已经满足；把对方没有新保证、他仍盼对方选择自己的限制单独说清，保留尚未满足的牵引。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\n        \"R56\"\n      ],\n      \"now\": [\n        \"S12-4\"\n      ],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留他暂时顾不上未来、只想让当下欢喜多留一会儿，以及欢喜退下后期待会回来的前后关系。用具体的心理活动代替“完整地停留”这一抽象总结，也让这一刻的满足没有被误写成缺憾已经消失。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "4d688e02-9603-456c-b5af-842eb6e127e9", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T163207927810Z", "elapsed_seconds": 644.984, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T16:42:52.918133+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "1f5e079de6f7f6f0bf8064752486135fb2b0605d9f6c2c262ec58b4a2cc0d75f", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}